  "_source": "Moontide's own walks to Captain Flarg and back. vip.toShop (spawn -> Flarg, then E) and vip.back (Flarg -> the fishing spot) were recorded in game with the Sol's RNG VIP gamepass (Setup > Routes, 2026-11-10; vip.toShop ends with the E press that opens his dialog). nonvip = the same walks with every wait x1.25 (without VIP you walk about 20% slower): an estimate, record your own walks without VIP. Each step is [key, down|up, ms waited before it] for Input.PlayRoute. Dialog and sell clicks live in coords.json. CraftTask reuses vip/nonvip toShop+back for the fisher (the same shop NPC as selling). cauldron is a placeholder to record in game (craft respawns after the cauldron; merchants use the Merchant Teleporter, no routes).",
